# Local sync runtime artifacts must never be committed
# The workspace directory: the repo's link to the platform, and the sketches it uploaded.
# `config.yaml` and `mockups/` are meant to be committed — a reviewer should see what an agent put on
# the platform. The rest is one machine's working state.
.localehub/state.json
.localehub/backups/
.localehub/cache/
.localehub/patches/
.localehub/*.local.yaml

